  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきには　ばくはつする　だんごを\nつかって　こうげき。　みかたには\nかいふくする　だんごを　あたえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대에게는 폭발하는 경단을\n사용하여 공격한다. 같은 편에게는\n회복하는 경단을 준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "對敵人使用時，用會爆炸的花粉團來攻擊。\n對我方同伴使用時，\n則給予有回復效果的花粉團。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Utilisé sur l’ennemi, envoie une boule explosive qui\nfait des dégâts ; sur un allié, donne du bon pollen\nnutritif qui fait récupérer des PV.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender greift mit einem Ball aus Pollen an,\nder beim Ziel explodiert. Mitstreiter werden von\neinem Ball getroffen, der ihre KP auffüllt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca al oponente con una bola explosiva. Si esta\nalcanza a un aliado, le hará recuperar PS.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca il nemico con una sfera\nesplosiva. Se colpisce degli alleati, fa recuperare\nloro dei PS.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user attacks the enemy with a pollen puff that\nexplodes. If the target is an ally, it gives the ally a\npollen puff that restores its HP instead.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵には　爆発する　だんごを\n使って　攻撃。　味方には\n回復する　だんごを　与える。",
      "language": {
